6. **Color batching** - Efficient theme-based calculations
7. **Helper function extraction** - Clean separation of complex logic

### Anti-Patterns to Avoid
1. **Overly aggressive memoization** - Can make code harder to maintain
2. **Perfect typing in test mocks** - Focus on functionality over perfect types
3. **Environment dependency** - Continue optimization work despite test environment issues
4. **Premature cache optimization** - Focus on React.memo and static extraction first

